      <title>Best Drug Recipe Profit Rankings</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/schedule-i/recipes/profit/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/schedule-i/recipes/profit/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;callout&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Short answer:&lt;/strong&gt; OG Kush 3-mix with &lt;span class=&#34;game-slot&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/game-icons/horse_semen.png&#34; alt=&#34;horse_semen&#34; class=&#34;game-img&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;game-name&#34;&gt;Horse semen&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt; + &lt;span class=&#34;game-slot&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/game-icons/mega_bean.png&#34; alt=&#34;mega_bean&#34; class=&#34;game-img&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;game-name&#34;&gt;Mega bean&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt; + &lt;span class=&#34;game-slot&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/game-icons/battery.png&#34; alt=&#34;battery&#34; class=&#34;game-img&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;game-name&#34;&gt;Battery&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt; gives $136 profit per unit at rank Peddler III 鈥?best profit-per-effort before automation. If you have Chemists running and want max per-unit profit, build the Cocaine 9-mix at Kingpin: $717 net per unit.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/diagrams/recipe-profit-chart.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Recipe Profit Per Unit&#34; class=&#34;schema-diagram&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; width=&#34;720&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;section-heading&#34;&gt;The Upgrade Path in 5 Steps&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;From Hoodlum to Kingpin, your recipe choices determine how fast you scale. Here is the exact sequence.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;upgrade-timeline&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;upgrade-step&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;step-marker&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;step-dot&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;step-rail&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;step-panel&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;step-rank&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;rank-name&#34;&gt;Hoodlum&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;rank-badge&#34;&gt;Tier 1&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;step-brew&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;game-slot&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/game-icons/og_kush.png&#34; alt=&#34;og_kush&#34; class=&#34;game-img&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;game-name&#34;&gt;Og kush&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;step-plus&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;game-slot&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/game-icons/banana.png&#34; alt=&#34;banana&#34; class=&#34;game-img&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;span class=&#34;game-name&#34;&gt;Banana&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;step-plus&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;game-slot&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/game-icons/cuke.png&#34; alt=&#34;cuke&#34; class=&#34;game-img&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;span class=&#34;game-name&#34;&gt;Cuke&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;step-metrics&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;metric-cost&#34;&gt;Cost ~$6&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;metric-arrow&#34;&gt;鈫?/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;metric-sell&#34;&gt;Sell ~$40&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;metric-sep&#34;&gt;路&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;metric-profit&#34;&gt;Profit ~$34&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;step-desc&#34;&gt;Buy everything from Albert and the first gas station 鈥?no alternative at this rank.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>How to Make Triple Dollar Strain: Best Custom Mix Recipes</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/schedule-i/recipes/triple-dollar-strain/</link>
