t;strong&gt;Sell price: $120+&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/tbody&gt;&#xA;&lt;/table&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;section-heading&#34;&gt;Popular Custom Strains&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here are community-discovered custom strain recipes that sell for higher than standard mixes:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
